<title>USA: First Cash Inc Q3 April 30 net increases.</title>
<headline>First Cash Inc Q3 April 30 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Texas 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   Apr 30,     Apr 30,   Apr 30,    Apr 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	   1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues		 12,610	 9,728    37,027     28,460</p>
<p> Net income		  433	   330     1,782	1,104</p>
<p>Primary earnings</p>
<p>  per share		 0.11	  0.08	0.40	 0.29</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings</p>
<p>  per share		 0.10	  0.08	0.36	 0.29</p>
<p>			  (in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said both primary and fully diluted earnings per share reflect the effects of convertible securities, outstanding stock options and warrants.</p>
</text>
